  // Two of our own bots commit onto Renovate branches. taylorbot
  // <dev@giantswarm.io> pushes what the generated workflows produce
  // (zz_generated.helm-docs-regen.yaml, the update-chart and
  // sync-from-upstream flows). giantswarm-marge[bot] writes the bot PR's
